    ["　小丑们涌了过来，有的表演踩马车轮子不倒，有的匍匐于巨大的皮球上，有的往天空扔出一个个网球，又以滑稽的动作一一接住。\n　　梅丽莎看着这些表演，神情沉静地就像对方并不存在，班森努力了几次，并大声喝彩，可都没能调动起妹妹的情绪，自己也慢慢低沉。\n　　克莱恩紧抿嘴唇，远远望着这一幕，想要靠近却又不敢。\n　　忽然，他摸了下衣兜里的钱夹，有了一个想法。\n　　班森和梅丽莎继续前行，沉默地观看着各种表演。\n　　过了一阵，他们看到一个涂着红黄白等各色油彩的小丑跑了过来，先是往天上扔出一个个网球，接着在人们的注意力被吸引到半空时，不知从哪里变出了一束花，一束塞维亚菊。\n　　这束花凑到了梅丽莎和班森眼前，颜色金黄，象征着快乐。\n　　梅丽莎和班森略显茫然地望向对面的小丑，只见他满是红黄白等各色油彩的脸上，嘴角高高翘起，固定着一个快乐的笑容，浮夸的笑容，滑稽的笑容。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第二百一十三章 再看一眼"] = "Клоунs swarmed over, some performing by stepping on carriage wheels without falling, some crawling on huge leather balls, some throwing tennis balls into the sky, and catching them one by one with funny movements. \n Melissa watched these performances, her expression as calm as if the other party didn’t exist. Benson tried several times and cheered loudly, but couldn’t stir up his sister’s emotions, and he himself slowly became depressed. \n Klein pursed his lips, watching this scene from afar, wanting to approach but not daring to. \n Suddenly, he touched the wallet in his pocket and had an idea. \n Benson and Melissa continued to move forward, watching various performances in silence. \n After a while, they saw a Клоун painted with red, yellow, white, and other oil paints run over, first throwing tennis balls into the sky, and then when people’s attention was attracted to the air, he produced a bouquet of flowers from nowhere, a bouquet of Zinnia. \n This bouquet was brought to Melissa and Benson’s eyes, golden in color, symbolizing happiness. \n Melissa and Benson looked at the Клоун opposite with a slightly dazed look, only to see the corners of his mouth, which was full of red, yellow, white, and other oil paints, raised high, fixing a happy smile, an exaggerated smile, a funny smile. \n \n —— Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 213: Take Another Look",
